+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
+| airfoil | 64→128 | 1,126,737 / 1,345,249 | 3,328 / 2,304 | 512 | 22.7209→25.6755 |
+| darcy | 64→128 | 1,126,993 / 1,345,505 | 3,328 / 2,304 | 512 | 14.5665→16.4605 |
